: "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_09", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_12", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_13", "role": "confounder_control"}], "narrative": "I find no temporally ordered chain from 303 to 1293 within the window that meets the \u2264600 time-unit successive-hop constraint. There are no direct 303\u21921293 events (step_04). 303 only contacts a small set of targets in this interval (1409, 1465, 1583; step_05), while 1293's incoming contacts come from different nodes (step_07), and candidate intermediate links (e.g. 1583\u21921293) are absent (step_16). Time-resolved checks show 303's outbound events occur to 1409, 1465 and 1583 in distinct 600-unit windows (steps_21, _25, _29) and those recipients do not provide a temporally successive path into 1293 (steps_30, _31, _32). Static/aggregate views (steps_09, _11, _12, _13) show there is structural proximity and activity that might suggest a cascade if time were ignored, but the temporal evidence does not support a time-respecting cascade, so I conclude absent."}, "raw_final_response": "{\n  \"task_id\": \"t_b6ce5479\",\n  \"decision\": \"absent\",\n  \"mechanism\": \"cascade\",\n  \"entities\": [303, 1293],\n  \"window\": [28296, 66695],\n  \"confidence\": 0.82,\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_04\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_05\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_07\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_16\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_21\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_25\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_29\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_30\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_31\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_32\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_11\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_09\", \"role\": \"confoun